POWER BI MAP CONTEXT
  The Shape Map in powerbi/ draws context round the blocks, generalised and cut to the map frame:
  - suburbs and localities with the water mesh blocks cut out: Australian Bureau of Statistics, Australian Statistical
    Geography Standard (ASGS) Edition 3, Suburbs and Localities 2021, Mesh Blocks 2021 and Local Government Areas 2021,
    CC BY 4.0;
  - the Yarra, the Maribyrnong and other water areas cut out of the land: Vicmap Hydro, Water Area
    (HY_WATER_AREA_POLYGON), State of Victoria (Department of Transport and Planning), CC BY 4.0.
  Water is not a layer: it is the map background showing where no land is drawn.

